WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
Sometimes you just want to preview your Parquet file without writing a script.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:06.800
I'm going to show you how easy it is to do in Positron.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.960
Just drag and drop your Parquet file into the File Explorer, and the Data Explorer immediately

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.520
opens up in the workspace.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.840
At a glance, it shows you the column names, data types, distribution of values, summary

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.840
statistics, and percent missing.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:22.879
And it also shows a spreadsheet-like view of the contents, where you can temporarily

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:26.320
sort and filter for quick information gathering.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.440
If you want to make those changes permanent, it provides a SQL syntax to add it to your

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.440
code.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.119
And from there, you can dive into the rest of your analysis in Positron.

00:00:34.119 --> 00:00:36.680
Do you work with Parquet files often?

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.279
What would make your life easier?

00:00:38.279 --> 00:00:39.320
Let us know in the comments.

